message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Live Translation & Subtitles"
abstract: >-
  A Tauri desktop application that produces real-time captions for hybrid and
  in-person conferences. It captures a presenter's microphone, Windows
  system/Zoom audio, or both, and renders captions in a transparent,
  always-on-top overlay. Two modes are kept deliberately separate: live
  translation into English or French via Google Gemini or OpenAI realtime
  speech models, and same-language live subtitles via Mistral Voxtral. Built
  for the workshop "Digital Humanities and Artificial Intelligence in African
  Studies" / "Humanités numériques et intelligence artificielle en études
  africaines" (STIAS, Stellenbosch, 21-24 September 2026).
type: software
